  'it_is_installed_once_on_your_cloudflare': 'It is installed once on your Cloudflare account, and after that you can create as many sub links as you like. Nothing runs on your phone and it costs nothing.',
  'it_is_probably_written_up_there_where': 'it is probably written up there where it went.',
  'it_is_the_port_the_app_opens': 'It is the port the app opens on the phone itself to pass traffic. The default is 10808 and unless you have a particular reason, leave it alone. The important thing is that besides the number you enter, the app also uses “that number + 10000” (for checking connection state and country). That is why some numbers cause trouble even though they look valid — 21000, for instance, clashes with the range the app uses to test servers. If you enter an unsuitable number, the problem is written under the field and the save button will not work until you fix it.',
